flowchart LR
  PO[Purchase Order] --> IN[Inbound Shipment]
  IN --> REC[Receiving]
  REC --> PUT[Put-away]
  PUT --> LED[Inventory Ledger]
  LED --> RES[Reservation]
  RES --> PICK[Pick]
  PICK --> PACK[Pack]
  PACK --> SHIP[Shipment]
  SHIP --> PUDO[PUDO / Customer]
  PUDO --> RET[Return]
  RET --> REC
